.TH FRDP-AUTHD 8 "July 2026" "FreeRDP" "System Administration"
.SH NAME
frdp-authd \- PAM authentication broker for frdpd
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B frdp-authd
.RB [ --pam-service " " name " | " --config " " path ]
.BI --socket " absolute-path"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B frdp-authd
is the privileged authentication and account-policy broker used by
.BR frdpd (8).
It accepts only the bounded local IPC protocol, performs non-interactive PAM
authentication and account checks, resolves the canonical POSIX identity, and
issues a short-lived authorization token for the session manager.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI --pam-service " name"
Select the PAM service directly.
.TP
.BI --config " path"
Read the PAM service from the FRDP configuration.  This is mutually exclusive
with
.BR --pam-service .
.TP
.BI --socket " absolute-path"
Listen on the specified Unix-domain socket.
.TP
.B --help
Show command usage.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B FRDP_AUTH_TOKEN_KEY
Path to the owner-only shared authorization-token key.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR frdpd (8),
.BR frdp-sesmand (8),
.BR pam (8)
